<title>USA: Video Update acquires 10 units.</title>
<headline>Video Update acquires 10 units.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Video Update Inc said Thursday it acquired the assets of Longview, Wash.-based Video Warehouse Inc, a privately owned chain of 10 video rental stores.</p>
<p>Further terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Video Update said it will continue to look for acquisition opportunities.</p>
<p>Video Update has 289 video stores in North America of which 261 are corporate owned and 28 are franchised as of January 15, 1997. That excludes 23 Video View rental stores currently under management.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
